OL,3,GNEWSALower footfall and visitor numbers
OL,4,Arecorded in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisits to York's tourist attractions
OL,7,Fand city centre footfall have both
OL,8,Fdeclined so far this year compared with
OL,9,F2025, new figures show.
OL,11,FData published by tourism body Make It
OL,12,FYork showed city footfall monitors
OL,13,Frecorded 15.08 million visits between
OL,14,FJanuary and June, down 8% compared with
OL,15,Fthe same period last year.
OL,17,FVisits to attractions also fell by 17%
OL,18,Fyear-on-year during the first half of
OL,19,F2026.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
