OL,3,GNEWSALower footfall and visitor numbers
OL,4,Arecorded in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the report suggested there
OL,7,Fwere signs of improvement during the
OL,8,Fspring and early summer, with
OL,9,Fattraction visits increasing and some
OL,10,Fparts of the city recording higher
OL,11,Ffootfall.
